  "notes": "USAGE:\n{配合|はいごう} emphasizes mixing in precise proportions, unlike general mixing ({混|ま}ぜる). It is common in product descriptions, recipes, and technical contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {配合|はいごう}する: to blend / to compound\n- {配合|はいごう}{比率|ひりつ}: blending ratio\n- {配合|はいごう}{量|りょう}: amount blended in\n- 〜が{配合|はいごう}された: formulated with ~\n\nFORMS:\n{配|はい} (distribute) + {合|ごう} (combine).",
